.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.sp -1
.IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
\fB\fBurgent\fR\fR: configures the decoration of urgent clients\&. For attributes and children, see
